cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the associated paper and this archive."
title: "IARI_rice_leaf_diagnostics: leaf-position discriminant diagnostics for rice fertiliser regime"
abstract: >-
  Analysis code and data reproducing a leaf-position chlorophyll-index and PSII quantum-yield
  linear discriminant rule that separates fertilised from unfertilised rice at 30 days after
  transplanting, validated with whole genotypes held out of training.
type: software
